Subject: [PATCH] pango: make ApplicationServices optional on iOS

The Darwin branch tries to enable the CoreText path through ApplicationServices,
which is macOS-only. Make the framework dependency optional so the iOS build
uses the fontconfig/freetype/cairo path.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build	2023-03-02 05:19:55
+++ b/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:50:50
@@ -344 +344 @@
-                           dependencies: dependency('appleframeworks', modules: 'ApplicationServices'))
+                           dependencies: dependency('appleframeworks', modules: 'ApplicationServices', required: false))
@@ -349 +349 @@
-  pango_deps += dependency('appleframeworks', modules: [ 'CoreFoundation', 'ApplicationServices' ])
+  pango_deps += dependency('appleframeworks', modules: [ 'CoreFoundation', 'ApplicationServices' ], required: false)
